      "before": [
        {
          "eyebrow": "An early start",
          "heading": {
            "lead": "Positano,",
            "accent": "just for a moment."
          },
          "paragraphs": [
            "I do not photograph in Positano very often, but these two really wanted their session here. I am so glad we did it. From the beginning, they looked like they had stepped out of a film, and everything between us felt easy.",
            "It was summer, so we began very early. In a town where people usually fill every little street, those quiet morning hours are something special. We could walk, stop, and photograph without constantly waiting for space."
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "spreads",
      "eyebrow": "02 / An easy connection",
      "heading": {
        "lead": "Very little",
        "accent": "direction needed."
