      ],
      "before": [
        {
          "eyebrow": "An easy connection",
          "heading": {
            "lead": "Very little",
            "accent": "direction needed."
          },
          "paragraphs": [
            "I hardly had to tell them what to do. There was trust from the start, and they were so natural together that I could simply follow what was happening in front of me.",
            "I love sessions like this. You are still looking carefully at the light and every small detail, but the people bring so much of themselves that the photographs seem to find their own way."
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "dissolve",
