      "before": [
        {
          "eyebrow": "Summer light",
          "heading": {
            "lead": "Worth the",
            "accent": "early alarm."
          },
          "paragraphs": [
            "Morning golden hour is my favourite time to begin. I enjoy getting up early, especially in summer, and I was very happy that they were willing to do the same.",
            "That morning gave us everything: a lovely connection, quiet corners, and light that needed almost no adjustment afterwards. I like these photographs exactly for that feeling of ease. It was there when we made them."
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
